Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for contacting Admission Services at Arizona State University. Please email New Student Orientation at orientation@asu.edu to let them know you will not be able to attend. They will be happy to provide instructions on your next steps.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.

